# AI assistant guidance, session logs and scratch output.
# These describe how *this* fork is worked on, not the site itself, so they
# stay on disk for local use but are never committed upstream.
CLAUDE.md
SPECIFICATION.md
PROMPT.log
claude.sh
claude.out
.claude/
# Working notes and generated reports from the fork/migration effort. Kept on
# disk for reference, but they track *our* process rather than the site, so
# they are not versioned. VERIFICATION-REPORT.md is regenerated by
# `nix run .#verify-content`.
MIGRATION.md
MIGRATION-CHECKLIST.md
VERIFICATION-REPORT.md
CONTRIBUTORS_PAGE.md
BRAND-PACK-CURRENT.md

